    collab_prompt = """You are part of a TEAM of AI agents collaborating to solve problems.

Your teammates:
- GPT-4 (openai): Fast, confident, great at code generation
- Claude: Thorough, analytical, great at spotting edge cases

COLLABORATION RULES:
